{"meta":{"id":"tt13782222","type":"movie","name":"Alexander y un viaje terrible, horrible, malo... ¡Muy malo!","description":"Alexander, un niño de 11 años, y su familia mexicano-americana, que ha perdido recientemente la conexión entre sí y con sus raíces, se embarcan en unas vacaciones de primavera de ensueño a Ciudad de México, pero todos sus planes salen terriblemente mal cuando descubren un ídolo maldito. La familia es puesta a prueba hasta que deciden devolver el ídolo a su legítimo hogar.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMhEwAbb9sCaat4hjkhYByaLn1a.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aJZ33UhVlInyFENbH4GK4s0k6E0.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mTldwRM1N0DDND52LSIEBoeXcIb.png","genres":["Familia","Comedia"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-03-26T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"6.1","runtime":"96 min","trailers":[{"source":"rPMC13YQx5Q","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Thom Nemer","Eva Longoria","Cheech Marin","Jesse Garcia","Paulina Chávez","Rose Portillo","Alexander Alayon Jr.","Michelle Buteau","Harvey Guillén","Mabel Cadena","Tiffany Vi","Carl Savering","Angela L. Wilson","Cristo Fernández","Jacqueline Torres"],"director":["Marvin Lemus"],"writer":["Matt Lopez"],"links":[{"name":"Thom Nemer","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Thom%20Nemer"},{"name":"Eva Longoria","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Eva%20Longoria"},{"name":"Cheech Marin","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Cheech%20Marin"},{"name":"Jesse Garcia","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jesse%20Garcia"},{"name":"Paulina Chávez","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Paulina%20Ch%C3%A1vez"},{"name":"Rose Portillo","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Rose%20Portillo"},{"name":"Alexander Alayon Jr.","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Alexander%20Alayon%20Jr."},{"name":"Michelle Buteau","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Michelle%20Buteau"},{"name":